#: playerentity.cpp:178
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using pre-KDE4 version of KBattleship. Note that, according "
"to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed adjacent to one "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Twój procëmnik brëkùjë pre-KDE4 wersëjã KBattleship. Bôczë, że prawidła grë "
"dlô stôrszégò klienta, nie pòzwôlają na ùkłôdanié bótów przëlégająco jeden "
"do drëdżégò."

